          ],
          "value": "Interacts with FliS via its C-terminal domain (residues 537-576), interacts with FliW via its N-terminal domain (residues 1-44). May form a 3-way complex of flagellin, FliS and FliW simultaneously, in which FliS and FliW do not directly interact (By similarity)"
